[0.126, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[10A\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m⏺\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[1C\u001b[1m133\u001b[1C\u001b[22mlines\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1C\u001b[1mdocs/knowledge-graph-traversal-example.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[1C   \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m 2 \u001b[22m# Knowledge Graph Traversal Example: SRP → Extract Class\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22m> Demonstrates Syntagma MCP tools for navigating the software engineering knowledge graph: finding paths between concepts, exploring neighborhoods, and understanding how laws, smells, and refactorings relate. Includes a re\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[22mal tooling bug discovered during the session.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m 4 \u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[3C\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m 5 \u001b[22m## Scenario\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m 6 \u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                          "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                                                                                                                                                           \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m 7 \u001b[22mGiven a codebase suffering from **God Object**, an engineer wants to trace the relationship from the **Single Responsibility Principle** to the **Extract Class** refactoring — understanding why and how the refactoring enfo\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m   \u001b[22mrces the law.\u001b[39m                          \r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m 8\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m 9\u001b[1C\u001b[22m##\u001b[1CTools\u001b[1CUsed\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m…\u001b[1C+126\u001b[1Clines\u001b[1C(ctrl+o\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cexpand)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[1CRazz\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mmat\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mazzing…\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(1m\u001b[1C14s\u001b[1C·\u001b[1C↑\u001b[1C252\u001b[1Ctokens)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[1C⎿\u001b[1C Tip:\u001b[1CUse\u001b[1C/btw\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cask\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Cquick\u001b[1Cside\u001b[1Cquestion\u001b[1Cwithout\u001b[1Cinterrupting\u001b[1CClaude"]
